{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2021-08-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'DANAHER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF ALDEVRON', 'text': 'WASHINGTON , AUG. 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ("DANAHER") ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF ALDEVRON. AS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED, ALDEVRON WILL OPERATE AS A STANDALONE OPERATING COMPANY AND BRAND WITHIN DANAHER\'S LIFE SCIENCES SEGMENT.'}